WEBVTT

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:43.750
Thank you.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:33.020
You two get behind that rock.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:34.280
Billy and I will lead them off.

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:43.410
We've escaped the Volkites and we're heading for the beach.

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:54.450
The invisible ray gun will soon stop them.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:46.510
and Diana.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:11.980
At least those mechanical men can't follow us through those flames.

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:24.700
Sure.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.340
President of Atlanta.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.780
There's no doubt about it.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:30.540
We'll be right back.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:32.240
Don't worry, this will make for my papers.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:33.230
Yeah!

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:36.840
A reporter discovers civilization 10,000 feet below the ocean.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:39.760
Boy, I'd like to explore that city.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.120
So would I.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:45.090
Perhaps we'd better get back to the submarine before we run into any more of these strange peaks.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:01.760
Have you ever seen such people before?

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:02.470
No.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:03.000
Thank you.

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:05.040
But I'll bet you they're in league with Unger Khan.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:05.720
All right.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:06.090
Thank you.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.760
Priest of Atlantis, and we're returning with strange prisoners.

00:06:59.050 --> 00:06:59.690
Strange captain.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:01.070
Strange.

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:03.040
Who are they?

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:05.340
We believe them to be agents of Angakam.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:09.080
you know

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:10.170
in Atlantis.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.120
till we have broken the power of this evil you suffer.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:20.310
Before we could.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:22.800
If they turn and capture the strangers, the Volkites appeared.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.320
and destroyed them with their atoms.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.160
I wanted them alive.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:28.150
They are alive.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:35.260
Jared's men are captured, your majesty, and they're heading to the secret city.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:40.500
Take a strong force and recover the prisoners at any cost.

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:11.950
submarine and wait there. I'm going to follow that juggernaut and see what they're taking.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:15.420
Better not. It's too dangerous.

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:45.730
Shut up.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:46.610
Let us sleep.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:02.340
Don't, don't, don't, don't keep, don't keep.

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:06.500
Buddy, meet my friend, Sully.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.800
Please submit, this is Briony.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:13.400
Buddy, he wants us to go that way.

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:14.500
This way?

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:18.230
Yeah, General.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.080
We're more sociable.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.890
He is no prisoner. Release him.

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:49.200
Anga Khan, may more fittingly welcome you to my undersea kingdom of Atlantis.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:52.360
Your soldiers have already welcomed us.

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:56.550
They've killed my assistant and made off of my son and Lieutenant Corrigan.

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:59.520
The soldiers who attacked you were not my men.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:01.350
They were followers of Sharon.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:04.520
This Lieutenant Corrigan you mentioned and your son

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:06.900
have undoubtedly been made prisoners of that tyrant.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.720
They must be rescued immediately.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:14.720
Imperial Guard.

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.560
It is I who should thank you.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:29.970
Atlanta has been honored by a visitor from the...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:34.950
However, I'm curious to know how you were able to penetrate the depth of the ocean.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:40.490
We used a super submarine propelled by rocket motors, which I perfected especially for the purpose.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:55.190
Interesting, Professor. Do you think these rocket motors could be built powerful enough to lift this tower?

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:59.970
There's no limit to their size nor power. Given time and the necessary equipment...

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:04.640
...raise this tower to the world.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:06.960
Good. We shall start at once.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:12.230
Are you actually proposing to move this huge metal tower? Why?

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.700
Because it contains all the machinery...

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.280
...which has enabled me to harness the atom.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:18.990
The most destructive force known to science.

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:22.200
Once I reach the surface...

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:25.140
...I'll either become supreme ruler of the upper world...

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:26.430
...or destroy it!

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.960
Professor Norton would never agree to help you in such a...

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.400
He's insane if he thinks I will.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:37.420
We have ways of persuading people to do our bidding.

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:45.080
We will come to him.

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:48.100
This machine will merely transform his mind.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:49.790
so that he will obey me.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.640
Prepare the transformer.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:15.620
Formation.

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:32.220
Quick, the elevator.
